---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
import SkillBlock from '../components/SkillBlock.astro';
import WaveDivider from '../components/WaveDivider.astro';
import ProjectShowcase from '../components/ProjectShowcase.astro';
import ArtShowcase from '../components/ArtShowcase.astro';
import BlogTeaser from '../components/BlogTeaser.astro';
import { skills } from '../data/skills';
import { withBase } from '../utils/url';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main>
    <section>
      <Hero />

      <div class="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
          Hey there! I'm Aryan and I live in Jaipur. I've been programming since I was about 9. I've learned HTML, CSS,
          JavaScript, and Python. I've made many projects using these languages. In fact, this portfolio was made with
          vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. My aim is to delve into the field of data science using Python and innovate
          solutions to problems. I have a GitHub page that showcases most of my Python projects in machine learning.
          Apart from programming, I also draw a lot. I've been sketching since I was a kid and I also have an Instagram
          page for my artwork. I love to play football. My favorite player is Lionel Messi, probably the most agile
          dribbler in the history of humanity. I'm also a huge Star Wars fan. I'm in college right now. I'm studying
          B.Tech in Energy Sciences and Engineering at IIT Delhi - Abu Dhabi. I wish to use my skills to make a positive
          impact on other people's lives and solve global issues. This portfolio is still incomplete but do check it out.
        </p>
      </div>

      <Divider reverse />

      <SkillBlock title="Programmer At Heart..." skills={skills.programming}>
        <p>
          I have a deep passion for programming and I've been coding for 7 years now. When I was but a child, my dad
          bought me and my brother an iPad (2nd generation). I used to play a lot of games on that thing. It started out
          as an interest in understanding how video games like God of War, Uncharted, and Angry Birds were created. When
          we moved to Jaipur, my dad bought a PC and my brother introduced me to HTML for developing websites. After that
          I was hooked. In my free time, I'd learn HTML tags, CSS rules and slowly I moved on to JavaScript. I developed
          some websites really just for fun. Then I moved on to real programming and started out with Python. I learned
          mainly through YouTube and other sites rather than books or teachers. I explored a lot in Python, and developed
          an understanding of modules like OpenCV2, NumPy, Pandas, and Matplotlib. I got interested in machine learning
          and then I took a course on Deep Learning from IIT Madras. Since then I've been making 'projects' in Python for
          fun. That's about it and I wish to learn a lot more down the line. Right now, I've been trying to master
          programming much closer to low-level using C and C++. My favorite language has to be C++.
        </p>
      </SkillBlock>

      <Divider />

      <SkillBlock title="Artist For Life..." skills={skills.art} reverse>
        <p>
          Since I was quite young, I loved drawing. I would fill pages upon pages with scribbles and sketches and even
          today I feel the best way to pass time when I'm bored is to draw. I even had a small phase when I wanted to
          become a concept artist! I learnt how to draw digitally and I have an instagram page for showcasing my artwork.
          I've done a few courses on Udemy for both traditional and digital art. Though I don't use post anymore [Life
          caught up to me]. I still draw in my free time and I feel I'm quite good at it. I believe art is a way to escape
          the hectic life one leads and everybody should, even mildly, draw to ease off stress.
        </p>
      </SkillBlock>

      <Divider reverse />

      <SkillBlock title="Love all and the beautiful game" skills={skills.football}>
        <p>
          There are two sports I particularly enjoy, Badminton and Football. Both I love very much, though I'm no Lin Dan
          or Messi. On the other hand, I'll probably lose every ball or point and still have the wickedness to show up
          again on the ground. I think you can a lot about life from the games you play, and I'll never let playing not
          be an option to make friends or get out of my own mind.
        </p>
      </SkillBlock>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-sage">
      <WaveDivider variant="wave" fill="var(--color-sky)" shadow="var(--color-deep-blue)" />
      <ProjectShowcase />
    </section>

    <section class="bg-sky">
      <WaveDivider variant="chevron" fill="var(--color-sage)" shadow="var(--color-charcoal)" />
      <ArtShowcase
        quote="I would like to paint the way a bird sings"
        author="Claude Monet"
        link={{ href: withBase('/artwork/'), label: 'You can take a look at my artworks too' }}
      />
    </section>

    <section class="bg-sky">
      <WaveDivider variant="curve" fill="var(--color-deep-blue)" />
      <BlogTeaser />
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    margin: var(--gutter) 0;
    padding: 0 var(--gutter);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--color-teal);
  }

  .about h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2em;
  }

  .about p {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1250px) {
    .about h2,
    .about p {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 640px) {
    .about {
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      padding: 0 5vw;
    }

    .about h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .about p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
